join green_interviewer center
set {interview_day} = 4
set {company_name} = "GreenCorp"
set {interview_score} = 0
set {interview_health} = 10

green_interviewer: Hello! GreenCorp fokus pada sustainability. Apa pendapat anda tentang climate change?

[signal arg="timer_start"]

- Isu serius yang butuh action segera dari semua pihak
	set {interview_score} += 18
	set {interview_health} += 18
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	green_interviewer: Exactly! Collective action is key to fighting climate crisis.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Penting tapi bukan prioritas utama saya
	set {interview_score} += 5
	set {interview_health} += 5
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	green_interviewer: At least you acknowledge it. But we need passionate advocates here.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Hoax, cuaca memang selalu berubah
	set {interview_score} -= 20
	set {interview_health} -= 20
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	green_interviewer: That's exactly the mindset we're fighting against. Big red flag.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

- Tidak tahu, tidak peduli
	set {interview_score} -= 10
	set {interview_health} -= 10
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	green_interviewer: Apathy toward our planet's future is unacceptable here.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

[wait time="1.0"]
[signal arg="update_ui"]

leave green_interviewer
